    "Actual TCP histories cover current-view bootstrap states at stable sizes 3/4/5. The seven transition profiles only qualify scheduling arithmetic here; distributed learner/joint transitions are not inferred.",
    "Lost-ACK and source-rotation faults use real journals and endpoints with deterministic injected link outcomes, separate from the healthy TCP physical transcript. No fresh-JVM or full S/N closure is claimed.",
    "Invocation campaign count is at most six and actual unchanged resource admission may stop earlier. Original failed sources are never deleted just to retry. Governing-floor maintenance and crash/session recovery remain required.",
    "Historical provenance/ancestry transfer, newer-view discovery/adoption, autonomous election, learners/joint completion, carried voting/publication and complete Phase 3 qualification remain open."
